^"discovery"{
  tags: ["charge", "wall", "field", "boundary", "arrival", "electrostatics", "reference"]
  spirit_name: "charge-wall"
  status: "extracted"
  related_images: ["boonhonk-attentional-fluid", "cauldron-spw-fluid"]
  notes: "Commissioned as a design reference rather than as page decoration, and it changed the code: systems/arrival-electrostatics.css drew a ring around the whole seat with a soft inner bloom until this render showed the boundary is one side, the charge is grain concentrating toward it, and the nucleus is roughly one percent of the frame. The CSS now matches. When a discharge treatment drifts, compare against this."
